					"nextDialogs": [
						100051406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051406,
					"content": "它说是你的「长辈」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100051407,
					"content": "…勉强算是吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051408,
					"content": "不愧是你的家庭关系。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100051409,
					"content": "勉强？你这是什么口气，那么大一个屋子，就我一个管家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛巴斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051410,
					"content": "你和莱茵多特主人用过的瓶瓶罐罐，可都是我一只猫来清理的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛巴斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051411,
					"content": "你…不是一只猫吗？猫要怎么做管家啊，还要收拾瓶瓶罐罐…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051412,
					"content": "你怎么会飞在天上？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛巴斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051413,
					"content": "欸？我一直都会啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051414,
					"content": "我也一直都会。请不要把事实当做问题，这种问题找不到答案。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛巴斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051415,
					"content": "你，你你你…好生气！我要…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051416,
						100051417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051416,
					"content": "它的主人是莱茵多特…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051418
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100051418,
					"content": "我…我要拒绝听它讲话了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051419,
					"content": "闲话就到此为止。阿贝多，我此次前来，是受莱茵多特主人所命，向你递送口信。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛巴斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051420,
					"content": "咳咳…咳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛巴斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051421,
					"content": "「亲爱的阿贝多，很高兴你为那个课题找到了『自己认可的解』。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051422,
					"content": "「不过，被解答后的问题，就失去了为之思考的意义。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051423,
					"content": "「你脑子里那枚闲不下来的钟摆，现在应该已经快要摆向『无聊』那一端了吧？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051424,
					"content": "「那么，你不如尝试一下，自己向自己提问吧。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051425,
					"content": "「丢开『已知的答案』，寻找『未知的问题』。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051426,
					"content": "「问题总是比答案更有趣的，也更能打发时间。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051427,
					"content": "「我很期待，下次见面时，你会给我带来什么样的『问题』。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051428,
					"content": "「如果你能找到连我都未曾设想过的问题，那就最好了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051429,
					"content": "「虽然这种可能性不太大，但你还是先努努力吧，如果你运气够好，说不定真能吓我一跳。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051430,
					"content": "「对了，别想着造一个专门用来思考或者回答问题的『自己』。师父我已经试过了，压根没用。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051431,
					"content": "「最后说一句，我让赛巴斯顺便给你带了一份礼物，注意收起来，也别喂它吃东西，它根本不会饿。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051432
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「莱茵多特」"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051432,
					"content": "谨遵老师教诲。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051433
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 100051433,
					"content": "咳，咳咳咳，莱茵多特主人就说了这么多…真是费劲，咳咳…咳…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100051434
					],
					"speakerTitle": "赛巴斯"
				},
